> 
> Meanwhile, advancements in energy systems [62200] and the emergence of novel bioluminescent methods for pollution detection in water [55679] indicate that interdisciplinary approaches can lead to more efficient and adaptable solutions. These technologies not only present opportunities for immediate practical applications but also underscore the broader potential for sustainable innovation in addressing pressing global challenges.
> 
